---
layout: base.njk
title: Embed My
# No script but the site's: base.njk writes the policy first in <head>, and the color-scheme script
# is added to script-src by its hash at build (eleventy.config.js).
csp: "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'"
description: Apps that make and play H5P activities with no H5P server, built on an open-source player. The first, EmbedMy Lesson, turns a lesson you describe in ChatGPT into an activity you can play and download.
---
{% include "topbar.njk" %}

{#- The hub: what Embed My is, then its apps and the player they are built on, as cards. The cards
    and links are lists drawn without bullets, and Safari then reads one as a list only if it is
    told. A card's links say whose they are to a screen reader, which may list them apart from the
    card: "Privacy, EmbedMy Lesson". -#}
<main class="home" id="main">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero-words">
        <h1 id="page-title">H5P activities, made and played with no H5P server</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Apps that turn what you describe into an interactive H5P activity, built and played in
          your browser, with a <code>.h5p</code> file for Moodle or any other H5P site. Free, with
          no account, and nothing you make is kept by us.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" id="apps" aria-labelledby="apps-heading">
    <div class="wrap">
      <header class="band-head">
        <h2 id="apps-heading">Apps</h2>
        <p>Where you already work: in a chat app, which writes the activity from your request.</p>
      </header>
      <ul class="cards" role="list">
        {%- for app in site.apps %}
        <li><article>
          <h3>{% if app.href %}<a href="{{ app.href }}">{{ app.name }}</a>{% else %}{{ app.name }}{% endif %}</h3>
          <p class="card-tag">{{ app.kind }}</p>
          <p>{{ app.description }}</p>
          <footer class="links">
            {%- for link in app.links %}
            <a href="{{ link.href }}">{{ link.text }}<span class="visually-hidden">, {{ app.name }}</span></a>
            {%- endfor %}
          </footer>
        </article></li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band-tint" aria-labelledby="player-heading">
    <div class="wrap">
      <header class="band-head">
        <h2 id="player-heading">Built on an open-source player</h2>
        <p>The apps play H5P with Missing Elements' player and tools, which you can host yourself.</p>
      </header>
      <ul class="cards" role="list">
        <li><article>
          <h3><a href="{{ site.player.links[0].href }}">{{ site.player.name }}</a></h3>
          <p class="card-tag"><code>{{ site.player.package }}</code></p>
          <p>{{ site.player.description }}</p>
          <footer class="links">
            {%- for link in site.player.links %}
            <a href="{{ link.href }}">{{ link.text }}<span class="visually-hidden">, {{ site.player.name }}</span></a>
            {%- endfor %}
          </footer>
        </article></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

{% include "site-foot.njk" %}
